I am drinking coffee.
I take my mobile phone.
I open the weather app on the phone.
How is the weather today?
There is a picture of a sun in the app.
It is very sunny in the morning.
It is very hot outside.
It is not raining now.
I check the evening weather.
There is a picture of rain in the app.
It will rain in the evening.
There are no clouds in the sky now.
I drink the rest of my coffee.
I put the cup on the table.
